 r←AddWords new;exists;new_dist
 ⎕TGET WLOCK(-RGATE)   ⍝ WLOCK held by first reader and released by last
                        ⍝ WLOCK taken by any writer
                        ⍝ Therefore, writers may not write until last reader finished
                        ⍝ and only one writer may write at a time
 new←⊆new
 exists←(≢WORDS)≥WORDS⍳new
 :If ∧/exists
     r←'0 words added'
 :Else
     new/⍨←~exists
     WORDS⍪←new
     new_dist←new∘.Dist WORDS
     DIST←(DIST,(≢DIST)↑⍉new_dist)⍪new_dist
     r←(+/~exists)⍕⍛,' words added'
 :EndIf
 ⎕TPUT WLOCK(-RGATE)
